  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_039) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt (config_051) while keeping other components identical isolates the impact of the RNA encoder choice. It balances exploitation of the current top-performing setup with exploration of a new RNA encoder, avoiding redundant changes and focusing on a critical design decision."
